tionally failing until the startup fix lands.\n\nAssisted-by: Codex\nSigned-off-by: Paul Boyd <paul@pboyd.io>\n\n* fix(catalog): avoid rolling upgrade initialization deadlock\n\nInitialize catalog schema before leader election under a separate database lock. Bound startup and recovery with cancellation and a configurable timeout, and cover rolling upgrades and lifecycle cleanup.\n\nAssisted-by: Codex / Claude code\nSigned-off-by: Paul Boyd <paul@pboyd.io>\n\n* fix(catalog): remount routes on Reconnect to refresh mounted providers\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nSigned-off-by: Paul Boyd <paul@pboyd.io>\n\n* fix: prevent duplicate Type rows from a concurrent or legacy initializer\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nSigned-off-by: Paul Boyd <paul@pboyd.io>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Paul Boyd <paul@pboyd.io>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b3249bee2c003ae03139c8acdef4909ba8d59ab0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kubeflow/hub/git/trees/b3249bee2c003ae03139c8acdef4909ba8d59ab0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kubeflow/hub/git/commits/56b05282dcd5494c39c65afd4c55a2fa28d1c5f3","verification":{"payload":"tree b3249bee2c003ae03139c8acdef4909ba8d59ab0\nparent 31325417ada400a878beb0ddeb964846dcc5043a\nauthor Paul Boyd <paul@pboyd.io> 1790964338 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790964338 +0000\n\nfix(catalog): avoid rolling upgrade initialization deadlock (#3308)\n\n* test(catalog): reproduce rolling upgrade startup deadlock\n\nAssert HTTP readiness with a newly required datastore type while the old leader retains ingestion leadership. Keep the regression intentionally failing until the startup fix lands.\n\nAssisted-by: Codex\nSigned-off-by: Paul Boyd <paul@pboyd.io>\n\n* fix(catalog): avoid rolling upgrade initialization deadlock\n\nInitialize catalog schema before leader election under a separate database lock. Bound startup and recovery with cancellation an