0d987a69b6fc17ee5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22885912?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manaswinidas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manaswinidas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manaswinidas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manaswinidas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/manaswinidas","id":22885912,"login":"manaswinidas","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyODg1OTEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manaswinidas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manaswinidas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manaswinidas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manaswinidas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manaswinidas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/manaswinidas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kubeflow/hub/commits/cd6c366f3826ff9b23911fb1d9fb8750916681ed/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T06:39:05Z","email":"dasmanaswini10@gmail.com","name":"Manaswini Das"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T06:39:05Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor(ui): share catalog settings UI shells across Model and MCP (#3135)\n\n* refactor(ui): extract shared catalog settings UI components (Phase A)\n\nMove the lowest-risk, domain-agnostic pieces of the Model and MCP catalog\nsettings UIs into clients/ui/frontend/src/app/shared/catalogSettings/components/:\nYamlUploadSection, PreviewButton, ManageSourceFormFooter,\nCatalogSourceStatusErrorModal, ExpectedYamlFormatDrawer, CatalogSourceStatus,\nIncludeExcludeFiltersSection, and SourcePreviewPanel.\n\nDomain differences (copy, testids, extra fields) are passed in via props/slots;\nshared components never branch on catalog type. Model and MCP components\nbecome thin wrappers around the shared ones, preserving all existing Cypress\ntestids. CredentialsSection and the Hugging Face radios in SourceDetailsSection\nremain model-only and untouched.\n\nAssisted-by: Cursor\nSigned-off-by: manaswinidas <dasmanaswini10@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* refactor(ui): share catalog settings list/manage page shells and table (Phase B)\n\nAdd CatalogSettingsListPage, ManageSourcePageShell, SourceConfigsTable, and\nSourceConfigsTableRow under shared/catalogSettings/components/, generic over\nthe source-config shape via props (columns, visibility label/testid getters,\nstatus component, extra cells, delete-modal copy, testIdPrefix).\n\nMigrate ModelCatalogSettings/ManageSourcePage and\nMcpCatalogSettings/McpManageSourcePage screens to thin wrappers around the\nshared shells and table, removing the now-unused per-domain table row\ncomponents. All existing Cypress testids are preserved via testIdPrefix and\nexplicit label/column props.\n\nDocument the shared kit in shared/catalogSettings/README.md for future\ncatalog settings pages.\n\nAssisted-by: Cursor\nSigned-off-by: manaswinidas <dasmanaswini10@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* refactor(ui): DRY manage-source form layout and polish shells\n\nShare ManageSourceFormLayout between Model/MCP, surface toggle errors,\ndrop unused definition.id, and tighten README claims.\n\nAssisted-by: Cursor\nSigned-off-by: manaswinidas <dasmanaswini10@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(ui): restore source-specific toggle error message\n\nKeep Cypress and prior UX: always show\n\"Error enabling/disabling source <name>\" instead of raw API text.\n\nAssisted-by: Cursor\nSigned-off-by: manaswinidas <dasmanaswini10@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(ui): satisfy prettier on ManageSourceForm previewPanel prop\n\nFixes test-and-build ESLint failure on PR #3135.\n\nAssisted-by: Cursor\nSigned-off-by: manaswinidas <dasmanaswini10@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: manaswinidas <dasmanaswini10@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"10f1c3a0cabcbb68d84108f3e3128159568b5fa5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kubeflow/hub/git/trees/10f1c3a0cabcbb68d84108f3e3128159568b5fa5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kubeflow/hub/git/commits/cd6c366f3826ff9b23911fb1d9fb8750916681ed","verification":{"payload":"tree 10f1c3a0cabcbb68d84108f3e3128159568b5fa5\nparent 33bdf092d8cb81082028e8f1ce8aa7acab118e9a\nauthor Manaswini Das <dasmanaswini10@gmail.com> 1790318345 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790318345 +0000\n\nrefactor(ui): share catalog settings UI shells across Model and MCP (#3135)\n\n* refactor(ui): extract shared catalog settings UI components (Phase A)\n\nMove the lowest-risk, domain-agnostic pieces of the Model and MCP catalog\nsettings UIs into clients/ui/frontend/src/app/shared/catalogSettings/components/:\nYamlUploadSection, PreviewButton, ManageSourceFormFooter,\nCatalogSourceStatusErrorModal, ExpectedYamlFormatDrawer, CatalogSourceStatus,\nIncludeExcludeFiltersSection, and SourcePreviewPanel.\n\nDomain differences (copy, testids, extra fields) are passed in via props/slots;\nshared components never branch on catalog type. Model and MCP components\nbecome thin wrappers around the shared ones, preserving all existing Cypress\ntestids. CredentialsSection and the Hugging Face radios in SourceDetailsSection\nremain model-only and untouched.\n\nAssisted-by: Cursor\nSigned-off-by: manaswinidas <dasmanaswini10@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* refactor(ui): share catalog settings list/manage page shells and table (Phase B)\n\nAdd CatalogSettingsListPage, ManageSourcePageShell, SourceConfigsTable, and\nSourceConfigsTableRow under shared/catalogSettings/components/, generic over\nthe source-config shape via props (columns, visibility label/testid getters,\nstatus component, extra cells, delete-modal copy, testIdPrefix).\n\nMigrate ModelCatalogSettings/ManageSourcePage and\nMcpCatalogSettings/McpManageSourcePage screens to thin wrappers around the\nshared shells and table, removing the now-unused per-domain table row\ncomponents. All existing Cypress testids are preserved via testIdPrefix and\nexplicit label/column props.\n\nDocument the shared kit in shared/catalogSettings/README.md for future\ncatalog settings pages.\n\nAssisted-by: Cursor\nSigned-off-by: manaswinidas <dasmanaswini10@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* refactor(ui): DRY manage-source form layout and polish shells\n\nShare ManageSourceFormLayout between Model/MCP, surface toggle errors,\ndrop unused definition.id, and tighten README claims.\n\nAssisted-by: Cursor\nSigned-off-by: manaswinidas <dasmanaswini10@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(ui): restore source-specific toggle error message\n\nKeep Cypress and prior UX: always show\n\"Error enabling/disabling source <name>\" instead of raw API text.\n\nAssisted-by: Cursor\nSigned-off-by: manaswinidas <dasmanaswini10@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(ui): satisfy prettier on ManageSourceForm previewPanel prop\n\nFixes test-and-build ESLint failure on PR #3135.\n\nAssisted-by: Cursor\nSigned-off-by: manaswinidas <dasmanaswini10@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: manaswinidas <dasmanaswini10@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqthcJCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAss8QAGMnU3nTWiTG862hxOKpLuKl\n5lI0QlTQwqMn7KAnqOr03Qgokn90jUvhkRB520c6HT9PvF5qHGJzZGaJWSVf/VAG\nDAKW+0YsVjqoyz5ozO1nIK7fOu1CLwzAejtOqkOiW80BvTgDypO0dIvNpZh4i5G/\nW3o75CBoUd+uJaNHQw9t8JCQAGIpvIbiuHAFGnDOsScV8XJKYBG6SoHR/gkJb1Yh\nHTOsdUJiVqjBN3we6D