083a4df8be89ff4fada179ae3d65316ca610e7b"}],"sha":"509cfc7229ffee39cd1631329bdeb1e5760e710a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kubeflow/hub/commits/509cfc7229ffee39cd1631329bdeb1e5760e710a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186957976?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DsThakurRawat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DsThakurRawat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DsThakurRawat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DsThakurRawat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DsThakurRawat","id":186957976,"login":"DsThakurRawat","node_id":"U_kgDOCyTAmA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DsThakurRawat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DsThakurRawat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DsThakurRawat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DsThakurRawat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DsThakurRawat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DsThakurRawat","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kubeflow/hub/commits/c083a4df8be89ff4fada179ae3d65316ca610e7b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T17:39:13Z","email":"divyanshrawatofficial@gmail.com","name":"Divyansh Rawat"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T17:39:13Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(catalog): add RFC 8594 deprecation headers to alpha catalog APIs (#3221)\n\nKEP-0004 says both alpha API versions carry Deprecation and Sunset\nheaders during the deprecation window. The registry proxy did this\nbehind --alpha-sunset-date; the catalog server did not.\n\nMove the deprecation middleware to the shared platform package and let\nit take a list of deprecated prefixes with their successors. The proxy\nkeeps its single registry pair. The catalog server derives one pair per\nplugin still served under an alpha version and mounts the middleware\nwhen --alpha-sunset-date (or CATALOG_ALPHA_SUNSET_DATE) is set, so\n/api/{model,mcp,agent}_catalog/v1alpha1/ responses now advertise their\n/v1/ successors. Plugins already on v1 are untouched.\n\nAssisted-by: Claude Code\n\nSigned-off-by: Divyansh Rawat <divyanshrawatofficial@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"5982100169731669ea897c3cc6e6a75cc0fb095c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kubeflow/hub/git/trees/5982100169731669ea897c3cc6e6a75cc0fb095c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kubeflow/hub/git/commits/c083a4df8be89ff4fada179ae3d65316ca610e7b","verification":{"payload":"tree 5982100169731669ea897c3cc6e6a75cc0fb095c\nparent 32292555ee8d0e91d0ecb9434ceaae8af64a4ac6\nauthor Divyansh Rawat <divyanshrawatofficial@gmail.com> 1790098753 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790098753 +0000\n\nfeat(catalog): add RFC 8594 deprecation headers to alpha catalog APIs (#3221)\n\nKEP-0004 says both alpha API versions carry Deprecation and Sunset\nheaders during the deprecation window. The registry proxy did this\nbehind --alpha-sunset-date; the catalog server did not.\n\nMove the deprecation middleware to the shared platform package and let\nit take a list of deprecated prefixes with their successors. The proxy\nkeeps its single registry pair. The catalog server derives one pair per\nplugin still served under an alpha version and mounts the middleware\nwhen --alpha-sunset-date (or CATALOG_ALPHA_SUNSET_DATE) is set, so\n/api/{model,mcp,agent}_catalog/v1alpha1/ responses now advertise their\n/v1/ successors. Plugins already on v1 are untouched.\n\nAssisted-by: Claude Code\n\nSigned-off-by: Divyansh Rawat <divyanshrawatofficial@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqsr1BCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAJAIQAGd6bsuce5SyLAx6nd9L3TqJ\nWTWhOZJbb4gDi89kPotjh7febc1O/UEf3YPSXrY2I3vQw/rNvDC98SvUaiU85q0m\npO9BFcZM1UMjZDcOGJTXMG2KnJHJR2bD3cDaGY8W