url":"https://api.github.com/users/DsThakurRawat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DsThakurRawat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DsThakurRawat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DsThakurRawat","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kubeflow/hub/commits/399ed42833628179790549f0f782de3575bbddf5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T18:18:18Z","email":"divyanshthakur594@gmail.com","name":"Divyansh Rawat"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T18:18:18Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(catalog): stop paginate from panicking on an empty artifact list (#3198)\n\npaginate slices list.Items at index+1 after a range loop that never\nruns when the list is empty, so a performance artifact request with\nrecommendations=true and any valid nextPageToken panics with\n\"slice bounds out of range [1:0]\" once every artifact has been\nfiltered out. Start after the cursor only when it is found in the\nlist; otherwise there is nothing after it.\n\nAssisted-by: Claude Code\n\nSigned-off-by: Divyansh Rawat <divyanshrawatofficial@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"af0296444fd0a43c6eeadd7a5fe8f6ebb8ba71cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kubeflow/hub/git/trees/af0296444fd0a43c6eeadd7a5fe8f6ebb8ba71cb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kubeflow/hub/git/commits/399ed42833628179790549f0f782de3575bbddf5","verification":{"payload":"tree af0296444fd0a43c6eeadd7a5fe8f6ebb8ba71cb\nparent af760adf6cb1b3a6d0a8a85c16ae86be9bd9d1cb\nauthor Divyansh Rawat <divyanshthakur594@gmail.com> 1789064298 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789064298 +0000\n\nfix(catalog): stop paginate from panicking on an empty artifact list (#3198)\n\npaginate slices list.Items at index+1 after a range loop that never\nruns when the list is empty, so a performance artifact request with\nrecommendations=true and any valid nextPa