space separator for\noption keys, matching translateLabel.\n\nFixes pimcore/platform-version#461\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e18ee4e72906bdbd95635fcc937a83044e400106","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/studio-ui-bundle/git/trees/e18ee4e72906bdbd95635fcc937a83044e400106"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/studio-ui-bundle/git/commits/351f5901a437f8aaa994df7073193e97e0c77c26","verification":{"payload":"tree e18ee4e72906bdbd95635fcc937a83044e400106\nparent 6f58dc7279897687fa49a73ca83dd0a696461d80\nauthor JiaJia Ji <kingjia90@gmail.com> 1791452929 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791452929 +0200\n\nKeep colons in Select/Multiselect option labels (#4172)\n\nconvertSelectOptions translated option keys with the default i18next\nnsSeparator '':'', so a key like ''08:00'' was parsed as namespace ''08'' +\nkey ''00'' and rendered as ''00''. Disable the namespace separator for\noption keys, matching translateLabel.\n\nFixes pimcore/platform-version#461\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqx2cBCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAamAQAFLwkUiUNcugXc4RFs1LsQMN\nh9k94EP/t9qQ6OHlPvyIX0QlKS7tb1ACxM2tn7NTTtv3RBSmj6uSzGXmsS9ashY9\n6rzySDldH5+uFLf2acjzHuiU6bIeZWI6WJyND73fbOA8n44P6BuX1+QBUa7ByczY\ndhz2k6cZTNicO7/fEX8OjhcjIR0LRZXdsEoe4N4yK8oVUUzk4BcXjYfoiasYkrkb\n3ZL/zvjtEIn6ezqt6MQPyNC6FDUpe0qsE+oHp/A3lGfUWibvP5kuI85sHOEPE61o\nZDJZjBd/G5JGSx5MC7ci0xZO0aa5P43SP+bNYcbeg3DzlJdVDYCX7NhLnuGBsvqa\ncoLYr4UNK4YfisKEtOV0h1+bR7lb8zJkMg4Z94T71p/VAYrCJX9mlj0dCDZK54i9\nTmSO3PBPLbDv11lA11YcteHLpOqrTMxVYtXxcjhE6NnY1XBO5ExkmHtKmR5rqE2x\nJ6yv76KaHotb3w1iAOtZUe6YdEWgmehJWaJTjlHO/fMrJ+zDQslPh3wtQDw0KnXV\n60WoWs9kFXS23X3SOtoY6F8aWH79IjZHyUQGDfluR0Ke1DYLpd6dPO4CxVHw7IqU\nIzq7Zscw+63rgb9DDRs16gJT/mG4pV1jSICG5aL1teg7TaOEjs+YdfBUt/cbkd0Y\nBaihys7oVFN8q+wcFE2L\n=E+hi\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-08T09:48:49Z"}},"