bscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertSt7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertSt7","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/studio-ui-bundle/commits/8fa38688fd0e57372134db8c5a9be66e6f9dfa00/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T09:15:21Z","email":"104770750+robertSt7@users.noreply.github.com","name":"robertSt7"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T09:15:21Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[Search] Data object selector fails to open: object column loader needs a SearchProvider (#4149)\n\n* [Search] The object column loader no longer needs a SearchProvider\n\nThe element selectors reuse the object search listing''s column loader outside the\nQuick Search modal, where no SearchProvider exists, so reading the pending restore\nthrough useSearch() threw when a data object selector opened. The loader now reads it\nthrough usePendingRestore(), which yields no pending restore without a provider and\nbehaves as before inside one.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"415c2cb406f41307cd60623e46c678679d9f6e7d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/studio-ui-bundle/git/trees/415c2cb406f41307cd60623e46c678679d9f6e7d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/studio-ui-bundle/git/commits/8fa38688fd0e57372134db8c5a9be66e6f9dfa00","verification":{"payload":"tree 415c2cb406f41307cd60623e46c678679d9f6e7d\nparent 98cf20c6c2a6b05fa35aea136aa816dad8302169\nauthor robertSt7 <104770750+robertSt7@users.noreply.github.com> 1791450921 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791450921 +0200\n\n[Search] Data object selector fails to open: object column loader needs a SearchProvider (#4149)\n\n* [Search] The object column loader no longer needs a SearchProvider\n\nThe element selectors reuse the object search listing''s column loader outside the\nQuick Search modal, where no SearchProvider exists, so reading the pending restore\nthrough useSearch() threw when a data object selector opened. The loader now reads it\nthrough usePendingRestore(), which yields no pending restore without a provider and\nbehaves as before inside one.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqx18pCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAALlIQAKgpwyPhHEBvnus3xrqQZ2IQ\n39EkRIFPPUggc1bpRmmTTMMwUL6auirSslA7I/d6+EBbXUtJlx7ScTW5U8KIEnYe\n26GaGTk3Biu4a7pwgZYzXnrHaPL5YRMVhqbyLoFt2SlMAMkE5IwNq06bgiFNz2ye\nJM0wj151gXMsFkDhKbjJ0fYLTaZasIpjeepwaCkicj0DLIKiVy/NDhvK9WM4cLpd\ns+K1GYsfUrYp9ZUd8fK7M5cyBi4k1Fmbx6kE1QM9Rsm2pq2G0fB9A5d0NJSlWR5N\nHWJfnWYLC9nqRz2j5T7Mrl7oXogpm7uDlQl0eeSzbsthI9O5LZk93KnTTJdKtGfG\nfm7DlBjU29oCic7ZKvJJyRbNyELQdLr3UVTuuIn3bafqWDVQkmNK2DpJh0f9wbRu\njjsgn4OcUXta1RdVZJkEtnnNKFXLDZyfydnjiS/FbarwfnDBbv/4SdmpaNa31/ry\na8G5kwTQsa++j+gOKAIeZx6SenRYo+xBYKvSxM8HDlFdKwBI52bVVrEU8mQ98yQq\nmY30IAjMi9ZjvDmfwyaura8i0bCmO/2AVy5YvaeanaEelejkqYV3WplUeh7R4F7/\nirQQrPKRm7Vu84cjBpWKnqDhHzfYmEYAo3w8sCstSySnTelLy9loiukyfwxcpEAI\nghLXz0hqR4hY6X041Hrv\n=pOj2\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-08T09:15:21Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/