","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/idaiv/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/idaiv/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/idaiv","id":138690998,"login":"idaiv","node_id":"U_kgDOCERBtg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/idaiv/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/idaiv/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/idaiv/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/idaiv/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/idaiv/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/idaiv","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/studio-ui-bundle/commits/77bbbf5867330453b244775c5ca5752c3ac014b4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T11:38:10Z","email":"138690998+idaiv@users.noreply.github.com","name":"idaiv"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T11:38:10Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[Classification Store] Align header actions and empty state with the design (#4168)\n\n* [Classification Store] Align header actions and empty state with the design\n\n- Use the action button type for Add and Delete so they sit on the header separator\n- Show the shared empty state with a folder-search Add button when no group is assigned\n- Hide Add and Delete when the store is not editable or add/remove is disallowed\n- Raise small collapse headers to 40px and align the title with the action button\n- Use a softer hover fill for action buttons and token based padding for Delete\n- Drop the bottom padding below the data object draft alert\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n* [Classification Store] Address review feedback\n\n- Use IconTextButton for Add and IconButton for Delete\n- Use lodash isEmpty and isString for the new checks\n- Cover the empty state and the add/delete permissions with tests\n- Add a small collapse story with an action button\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2d6d84de3ccfc702e04b887a22c31d4fce58b51a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/studio-ui-bundle/git/trees/2d6d84de3ccfc702e04b887a22c31d4fce58b51a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/studio-ui-bundle/git/commits/77bbbf5867330453b244775c5ca5752c3ac014b4","verification":{"payload":"tree 2d6d84de3ccfc702e04b887a22c31d4fce58b51a\nparent dd967615028b44b43efe2649603963a01f4b7c78\nauthor idaiv <138690998+idaiv@users.noreply.github.com> 1791373090 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791373090 +0200\n\n[Classification Store] Align header actions and empty state with the design (#4168)\n\n* [Classification Store] Align header actions and empty state with the design\n\n- Use the action button type for Add and Delete so they sit on the header separator\n- Show the shared empty state with a folder-search Add button when no group is assigned\n- Hide Add and Delete when the store is not editable or add/remove is disallowed\n- Raise small collapse headers to 40px and align the title with the action button\n- Use a softer hover fill for action buttons and token based padding for Delete\n- Drop the bottom padding below the data object draft alert\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n* [Classification Store] Address review feedback\n\n- Use IconTextButton for Add and IconButton for Delete\n- Use lodash isEmpty and isString for the new checks\n- Cover the empty state and the add/delete permissions with tests\n- Add a small collapse story with an action button\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BE