ganizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fashxp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fashxp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fashxp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fashxp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fashxp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fashxp","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/studio-ui-bundle/commits/18beac3bbc467cbe04985853257de440a2314d56/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T08:11:50Z","email":"fashxp@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Christian Fasching"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T08:11:50Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Fix advanced column transformer defaults and empty-pipeline preview (#4156)\n\n* Fix advanced column transformer defaults and empty-pipeline preview\n\nA transformer''s or text source field''s default was shown but never\nsaved. The grid preview no longer requests before a source field exists.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CAUDMygVFT6TNKHvscT7rC\n\n* Use lodash guards and a non-subscribing read for keyed-list defaults\n\nuseCommitKeyedListDefault now reads via operations.getValue, so the host\ncomponent no longer re-renders on every change of its keyed list.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: fashxp <8792145+fashxp@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"0af8c889f39426daa45a9b09319fc05203b5e1bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/studio-ui-bundle/git/trees/0af8c889f39426daa45a9b09319fc05203b5e1bb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/studio-ui-bundle/git/commits/18beac3bbc467cbe04985853257de440a2314d56","verification":{"payload":"tree 0af8c889f39426daa45a9b09319fc05203b5e1bb\nparent 694e1fe04c7d58f24c8be7b0af1233e0bc3e5f22\nauthor Christian Fasching <fashxp@users.noreply.github.com> 1791360710 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791360710 +0200\n\nFix advanced column transformer defaults and empty-pipeline preview (#4156)\n\n* Fix advanced column transformer defaults and empty-pipeline preview\n\nA transformer''s or text source field''s default was shown but never\nsaved. The grid preview no longer requests before a source field exists.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CAUDMygVFT6TNKHvscT7rC\n\n* Use lodash guards and a non-subscribing read for keyed-list defaults\n\nuseCommitKeyedListDefault now reads via operations.getValue, so the host\ncomponent no longer re-renders on every change of its keyed list.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: fashxp <8792145+fashxp@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxf7GCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAzNwQAAstxnD/Uhu9Yuo6VuRJPX5B\nJS80LiD26tOWaLW/msD5wCSDY8P6gRZZTUyY2fiMTfkBYizP5UrKtK7w/8suiX0Q\nBe+3Bdkfd8GeFyAV2AbpFRiOHlvpdt9hf+3MMz+TUJ3u/yPqX/ByoMet/XNlHp+v\n77IP5ufjiTbT6H+oBwu6DDm+NP+4ex9pYloxnDZwh83D2drPS0a8dBO9Sjjxuzs3\nCfYfbt1hdYI0r/fAQc9uIwmQ21wTXgO/h+d33+YvV3HqHhqTmCTZmFxBeR0zyrQp\nyjKGXmAA0lfQOOA/2a95CLGlCPIW8qmpWwxUlgAlKe+Z1zDP+FN8iiGJb6yvXC8H\nIvOLqx+Nqnvm62HN88YvJFgnJ/3Dq2w6wH/vof2H3d9oimnZoyOJQnxI77rjM41S\n2Y39vYEq5sMHTfCDTN7VB4Bku67ypwiy8SwOK9AG7mLIIHGQyXTPIGP3sb1sD7Lq\npLxXa2pBsNICUMkzMkvmJHUits2ntfgCcSFbHDKhBCBqpy76fYD21E+8nj7Zs+Nu\nOVaI3aZkpcM66GgnRuqb8Yv4eWIqhcumjSJX0cKraTy72ncwHEU+WM+zaUr7fhnM\nod+sjCzXN690thNogOztRz5Yv44gtBG2CsOpUPMUsM+tdtxJ3PKtKVkLdkin9dSD\n/QXE/NQ+SRJHNKKh7ZfS\n=d7mT\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-07T08:11:51Z