nd XLSX exports\n\nThe grid request sends advanced columns under their uniqueId since #3966,\nso the export modals'' key lookup dropped them.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: fashxp <8792145+fashxp@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"9288b2927990abd076a3651c9ba74e5e6ab9d220","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/studio-ui-bundle/git/trees/9288b2927990abd076a3651c9ba74e5e6ab9d220"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/studio-ui-bundle/git/commits/694e1fe04c7d58f24c8be7b0af1233e0bc3e5f22","verification":{"payload":"tree 9288b2927990abd076a3651c9ba74e5e6ab9d220\nparent 55b9254d12ac555b30b1640ed1098caf4def312b\nauthor Christian Fasching <fashxp@users.noreply.github.com> 1791299950 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791299950 +0200\n\n[Bug] Keep advanced columns in CSV and XLSX exports (#4166)\n\n* Keep advanced columns in CSV and XLSX exports\n\nThe grid request sends advanced columns under their uniqueId since #3966,\nso the export modals'' key lookup dropped them.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: fashxp <8792145+fashxp@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxRFuCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAPmUQAE80v7yQWRp9x/vENh7tyice\nDrEtrd64zipX/H1ff1ZFYMEQqzb4nULtDTI1artbm/OqRt7JfY+Z2agWnOFLOTBY\nz+7HHKsfLVjqnKIhhv+tqhXZlA7zVxwVBmOSOsHm8QM5boYtrtBosi+ZFqhibEpS\njk9p4NBM0lanxrs8arf5prsbt+KMrAK4DqrqHPcjHQpJ9behR6bagrXWj9jYgzRK\nvNMtakBotSNqzmsXv3iZ9XyZxxs8tZN2CB3hJmWiP61fE1AAFmCK2SDUjLACoJDz\nuNL3MJCDwN3yZowzViybbq9ATbO66lpGLiBGa2TdLAnNoYRbucXDprCck030l1dX\njr9TQBopWtA9gdNHhRBtBdJnZl6JfcjspkJNBG8qtWP5ROkr2hEf14NwZJkVSTzJ\n946aFkj1hu1aY7GTJiKsxrHBf5cvYa1hxlyRQHqz6b+NSiYzUwD1J/oacxouLQ6z\niwZObuudQCuFWGPzeV/WOwPktlHEN