ZDBlYzQ0MmI3ZTA1MTBlMWEzYzI5Y2UxZDY1OWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pimcore/studio-ui-bundle/commit/8ee6a27da3f11b31a95f4940541f2a6720755270","sha":"8ee6a27da3f11b31a95f4940541f2a6720755270","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/studio-ui-bundle/commits/8ee6a27da3f11b31a95f4940541f2a6720755270"}],"sha":"a6dfe603945d0ec442b7e0510e1a3c29ce1d659a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/studio-ui-bundle/commits/a6dfe603945d0ec442b7e0510e1a3c29ce1d659a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8792145?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fashxp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fashxp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fashxp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fashxp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fashxp","id":8792145,"login":"fashxp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3OTIxNDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fashxp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fashxp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fashxp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fashxp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fashxp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fashxp","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/studio-ui-bundle/commits/55b9254d12ac555b30b1640ed1098caf4def312b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T08:55:10Z","email":"fashxp@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Christian Fasching"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T08:55:10Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[Bug] Fix grid request sending boolean config for classification store columns (#4160)\n\n* Fix grid request sending boolean config for classification store columns\n\nA classification store column without persisted config resolved to\n`false`, which the grid endpoint rejects with HTTP 500. Send `{}` instead.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n* Use lodash guards in resolveColumnConfig\n\nAddresses Copilot review feedback.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Jeer9sfLGdFQYNsLzAyd8S\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n* Drop keyless classification store columns from the grid request\n\nA classification store column without groupId/keyId is rejected by the\ngrid endpoint (422), so it is no longer selected or requested.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Jeer9sfLGdFQYNsLzAyd8S\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n* Share keyless classification store predicate and request filter\n\nOne predicate and filterRequestableColumns now live in the helper file;\nuse-data-query-helper imports it via the @Pimcore alias.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Jeer9sfLGdFQYNsLzAyd8S\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n* Reduce the grid config fix to the column config loader\n\nOnly the loader''s boolean fallback was wrong; send an empty config instead\nof false and drop the extra predicate and request filter.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Jeer9sfLGdFQYNsLzAyd8S\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: fashxp <8792145+fashxp@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"e95904e9e57b5b289e1a5ef08603cec968afe83c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/studio-ui-bundle/git/trees/e95904e9e57b5b289e1a5ef08603cec968afe83c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/studio-ui-bundle/git/commits/55b9254d12ac555b30b1640ed1098caf4def312b","verification":{"payload":"tree e95904e9e57b5b289e1a5ef08603cec968afe83c\nparent 05197da952932253848b947c07294c485c224299\nauthor Christian Fasching <fashxp@users.noreply.github.com> 1791190510 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791190510 +0200\n\n[Bug] Fix grid request sending boolean config for classification store columns (#4160)\n\n* Fix grid request sending boolean config for classification store columns\n\nA classification store column without persisted config resolved to\n`false`, which the grid endpoint rejects with HTTP 500. Send `{}` instead.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n* Use lodash guards in resolveColumnConfig\n\nAddresses Copilot review feedback.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Jeer9sfLGdFQYNsLzAyd8S\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n* Drop keyless classification store columns from the grid request\n\nA classification store column without groupId/keyId is rejected by the\ngrid endpoint (422), so it is no longer selected or requested.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Jeer9sfLGdFQYNsLzAyd8S\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n* Share keyless classification store predicate and request filter\n\nOne predicate and filterRequestableColumns now live in the helper file;\nuse-data-query-helper imports it via the @Pimcore alias.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Jeer9sfLGdFQYNsLzAyd8S\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n* Reduce the grid config fix to the column config loader\n\nOnly the loader''s boolean fallback was wrong; send an empty config instead\nof false and drop the extra predicate and request filter.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Jeer9sfLGdFQYNsLzAyd8S\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropi