matic frontend build","tree":{"sha":"1f62e053d336c3233c5763c0e926c574780f9d92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/studio-ui-bundle/git/trees/1f62e053d336c3233c5763c0e926c574780f9d92"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/studio-ui-bundle/git/commits/bbabbf7bd63843eabdc0c91b0a861db830de06c6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","id":41898282,"login":"github-actions[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pimcore/studio-ui-bundle/commit/bbabbf7bd63843eabdc0c91b0a861db830de06c6","node_id":"C_kwDOLGAHt9oAKGJiYWJiZjdiZDYzODQzZWFiZGMwYzkxYjBhODYxZGI4MzBkZTA2YzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pimcore/studio-ui-bundle/commit/9265f2707e4b1b4ea2332953fc66bae2ccc81433","sha":"9265f2707e4b1b4ea2332953fc66bae2ccc81433","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/studio-ui-bundle/commits/9265f2707e4b1b4ea2332953fc66bae2ccc81433"}],"sha":"bbabbf7bd63843eabdc0c91b0a861db830de06c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/studio-ui-bundle/commits/bbabbf7bd63843eabdc0c91b0a861db830de06c6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/259032526?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcPimcore/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcPimcore/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcPimcore/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcPimcore/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jcPimcore","id":259032526,"login":"jcPimcore","node_id":"U_kgDOD3CFzg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcPimcore/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcPimcore/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcPimcore/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcPimcore/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcPimcore/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcPimcore","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/studio-ui-bundle/commits/9265f2707e4b1b4ea2332953fc66bae2ccc81433/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T13:46:22Z","email":"jochen.califice@pimcore.com","name":"JochenC"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T13:46:22Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[Many-to-many relation] Fix removing an item restoring a previously removed item (#4157)\n\n* [Many-to-many relation] Fix removing an item restoring a previously removed item\n\nGridRow memoized its visible cells without depending on the columns prop,\nso rows whose data and index did not change kept stale cell renderers.\nThe relation''s trash button therefore called a deleteItem closure holding\nan outdated value, e.g. [A,B,C,D] -> remove D -> remove A resulted in\n[B,C,D] instead of [B,C].\n\n- Recompute GridRow visible cells when columns change\n- Read the latest value in useValue deleteItem/getOriginalIndex\n- Add regression test for useValue\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n* [Many-to-many relation] Use lodash isNull for null check in deleteItem\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n* Trigger CI\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: jcPimcore <259032526+jcPimcore@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"4bd18d9a3551851b63f38dbe2ed369bd791b6a2d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/studio-ui-bundle/git/trees/4bd18d9a3551851b63f38dbe2ed369bd791b6a2d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/studio-ui-bundle/git/commits/9265f2707e4b1b4ea2332953fc66bae2ccc81433","verification":{"payload":"tree 4bd18d9a3551851b63f38dbe2ed369bd791b6a2d\nparent 0e08b29a5f5f29bfa380ec7433ce9c1432857881\nauthor JochenC <jochen.califice@pimcore.com> 1790948782 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790948782 +0200\n\n[Many-to-many relation] Fix removing an item restoring a previously removed item (#4157)\n\n* [Many-to-many relation] Fix removing an item restoring a previously removed item\n\nGridRow memoized its visible cells without depending on the columns prop,\nso rows whose data and index did not change kept stale cell renderers.\nThe relation''s trash button therefore called a deleteItem closure holding\nan outdated value, e.g. [A,B,C,D] -> remove D -> remove A resulted in\n[B,C,D] instead of [B,C].\n\n- Recompute GridRow visible cells when columns change\n- Read the latest value in useValue deleteItem/getOriginalIndex\n- Add regression test for useValue\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n* [Many-to-many relation] Use lodash isNull for null check in deleteItem\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n* Trigger CI\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: jcPimcore <259032526+jcPimcore@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqv7WuCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAVWcQAAl5VfKTrwYQFVHWhzUCBQfU\nfwWaj/LK3w9qPCNvHjeiA7uzihZwgKk+2Gyx0zGLlFPVDk3e7u97Q7K9zdubS9xv\nNKXgAcbDsP3kNF+mZEp1xEc3JQ8WujxiWNcz9xKppDJUXVVk0lPsP0aNsIta1fRd\n+ntIT8C6XQHwCTLh/2uDq6Q5AFOLBG+85fBZ2X2Z8lxUEVvMWGvPmWbO2pG5BfNB\nIxXckeX4ZTz49t70RK+8plPOMvqEDbcJbwIIGX6QKFCSt4eivH/gRfMMARLfdUgG\nri0fId0sH4uKZdouEp2ehG361LdU7bVlfF0ECsHoiJwL8OLj7WoqcXeDG7YYZYNC\nQtSi5WerP2ruEw6iuhF8Lu9kMiVqhSJxz21FSbqgzXOY6JT6/yVcfuiJHJOSGxDS\nlN4FjoWm8cCF6OuJCRVs8/LZKgaukKjV+9EiPDKU6MhoMrKTPWqTHTjOZMzTlEKi\nHmZYoJRGjJA5E/M15hMlwJcbJaXH5huw5ZtQzt9df+RP/nqen9CQUfKsbm5uwKnD\nIBlhcRA881+16R8Y7P0VWoOSFUJbVNH6HtcziaGC03mHo+PUnJHbeHGjve8dmU1a\nRR0rH9G51S+iv+HttU/nMXJ/PpK0tGwckx0tAgFzmw58a8DISDQAMp633VR/P7eL\njoGpgVuahpzNk9KpiliS\n=YAPM\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T13:46:23Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pimcore/studio-ui-bundle/commit/9265f2707e4b1b4ea2332953fc66bae2ccc81433","node_id":"C_kwDOLGAHt9oAKDkyNjVmMjcwN2U0YjFiNGVhMjMzMjk1M2ZjNjZiYWUyY2NjODE0MzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pimcore/studio-ui-bundle/commit/0e08b29a5f5f29bfa380ec7433ce9c1432857881","sha":"0e08b29a5f5f29bfa380ec7433ce9c1432857881","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/studio-ui-bundle/commits/0e08b29a5f5f29bfa380ec7433ce9c1432857881"}],"sha":"9265f2707e4b1b4ea2332953fc66bae2ccc81433","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/studio-ui-bundle/commits/9265f2707e4b1b4ea2332953fc66bae2ccc81433"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/259032526?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcPimcore/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcPimcore/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcPimcore/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcPimcore/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jcPimcore","id":259032526,"login":"jcPimcore","node_id":"U_kgDOD3CFzg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcPimcore/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcPimcore/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcPimcore/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcPimcore/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcPimcore/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcPimcore","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/studio-ui-bundle/commits/0e08b29a5f5f29bfa380ec7433ce9c1432857881/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T12:13:53Z","email":"jochen.califice@pimcore.com","name":"JochenC"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T12:13:53Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[CI] Conflict with phpunit 13.4 until Codeception supports it (#4158)\n\nCodeception 5.3.6 is not compatible with phpunit 13.4.0 and fails with\n\"Too few arguments to function PHPUnit\\TextUI\\CliArguments\\Builder::__construct()\".\npimcore/pimcore#19517 adds the same conflict to core 2026.3, but this branch\nresolves pimcore/pimcore ^12.3 to v12.3.12.1, which does not include it.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5d2938c5de3dcfe02c133de427a474fb299680ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/studio-ui-bundle/git/trees/5d2938c5de3dcfe02c133de427a474fb299680ed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/studio-ui-bundle/git/commits/0e08b29a5f5f29bfa380ec7433ce9c1432857881","verification":{"payload":"tree 5d2938c5de3dcfe02c133de427a474fb299680ed\nparent 574a8381827d06359813174e59eb961be5d047d5\nauthor JochenC <jochen.califice@pimcore.com> 1790943233 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790943233 +0200\n\n[CI] Conflict with phpunit 13.4 until Codeception supports it (#4158)\n\nCodeception 5.3.6 is not compatible with phpunit 13.4.0 and fails with\n\"Too few arguments to function PHPUnit\\TextUI\\CliArguments\\Builder::__construct()\".\npimcore/pimcore#19517 adds the same conflict to core 2026.3, but this branch\nresolves pimcore/pimcore ^12.3 to v12.3.12.1, which does not include it.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqv6ABCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAMyUQAArXu7zIFr/byLMqfUeecey5\ni+19GL111255CdnrXqBEpsm/OA2a/CKXBJ+/8jdhW9gGEgJC8w4CbVf4k0ZxsGe6\nj0VKNso2uGQmXgkcGLJVvd7u+4qh9AB51ag9TqYm2n8rjsUW4UQowwrt2fT3Xmdz\nAn22TJJQLKcP3EEZOzB5FRMtQgrAFXQIzwZYinETTYUg///fBMXCOfOKqgg9sIEb\nQyqo36mkPWy9YY66bpNDU9jU4EMSCVPLT6r5YTXIGX+I1uiYjkPM/3dtQSR4vWIU\nyStN+ud7obCAR6GKFbD2bljLhb6N6qfiZtlrkxu3gLCftfTLWxRuEZhartS+JLGr\nt8M2dDVvyUhDkOsz5LGx6qMTO1t7Op2DSFBjNldmL6flXSgIeBkL/XW7HPegJ0Yl\nIVHAgEh/JsmwsB1vd13V