npoints users at the wrong use case: normal web thumbnails already get a 1x/2x\nsrcset. Use the explanation from the classic admin UI\n(high_resolution_info_text) instead, as intended in #3058 (3be08793 was\npushed to the branch after that PR merged and never landed).\n\nAll 8 target locales updated; validate_translations.py reports 0 errors.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Limit this PR to nl and pl; the rest ships via 2025.4\n\nThe en, de, fr, it, es, sv and no changes now land on 2025.4 in #4154 and\nreach 2026.3 through the forward-merge. nl and pl do not exist on 2025.4, so\nthey stay here.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"08c7ee3e1d9d9ce3d1e564905d1d462bfb3e770c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/studio-ui-bundle/git/trees/08c7ee3e1d9d9ce3d1e564905d1d462bfb3e770c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/studio-ui-bundle/git/commits/f705502092b5753a2cc160f7c6eab8c634d86aa6","verification":{"payload":"tree 08c7ee3e1d9d9ce3d1e564905d1d462bfb3e770c\nparent bd0362e9f430b87a46a6ea0ebd1bb2588b6bf040\nauthor Tine <42359615+xIrusux@users.noreply.github.com> 1790866081 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790866081 +0200\n\n[Image Thumbnails] Restore the classic High Resolution help text (nl, pl) (#4153)\n\n* Restore the classic High Resolution help text in the thumbnail editor\n\nThe Studio tooltip said \"High resolution factor for retina displays\", which\npoints users at the wrong use case: normal web thumbnails already get a 1x/2x\nsrcset. Use the explanation from the classic admin UI\n(high_resolution_info_text) instead, as intended in #3058 (3be08793 was\npushed to the branch after that PR merged and never landed).\n\nAll 8 target locales updated; validate_translations.py reports 0 errors.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Limit this PR to nl and pl; the rest ships via 2025.4\n\nThe en, de, fr, it, es, 