ed_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/idaiv/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/idaiv/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/idaiv/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/idaiv/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/idaiv","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/studio-ui-bundle/commits/40b841fcbf05e7aa02113e768f27b8b647f8d0eb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T07:59:24Z","email":"138690998+idaiv@users.noreply.github.com","name":"idaiv"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T07:59:24Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[Studio UI] Add keyboard navigation to search results (#4058)\n\n* [Studio UI] Add keyboard navigation to search results\n\nSearch result items now support keyboard interaction:\n- ArrowDown/Up to navigate between results\n- Enter to open the selected result\n- role=\"option\" on items, role=\"listbox\" on container\n- First item gets tabIndex=0 for keyboard entry\n\nFixes WCAG 2.1 2.1.1 (Keyboard) for the search modal.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n* [Studio UI] Fix dual tabIndex and add aria-selected on search results\n\n- first prop only true when no item is selected (prevents two\n  tabIndex=0 items in the listbox)\n- Added aria-selected on each option for screen readers\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n* [Studio UI] Remove stale audit doc from PR scope\n\nThe keyboard-navigation-audit.md was accidentally included. It''s a\npre-remediation snapshot that becomes stale as fixes land.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"61c3ed6e3091dfcdc26cd8d1f36f063e4bcf07dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/studio-ui-bundle/git/trees/61c3ed6e3091dfcdc26cd8d1f36f063e4bcf07dd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/studio-ui-bundle/git/commits/40b841fcbf05e7aa02113e768f27b8b647f8d0eb","verification":{"payload":"tree 61c3ed6e3091dfcdc26cd8d1f36f063e4bcf07dd\nparent dd3c68cfd9048fa12bfb0c17941c365d66c25565\nauthor idaiv <138690998+idaiv@users.noreply.github.com> 1790841564 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790841564 +0200\n\n[Studio UI] Add keyboard navigation to search results (#4058)\n\n* [Studio UI] Add keyboard navigation to search results\n\nSearch result items now support keyboard interaction:\n- ArrowDown/Up to navigate between results\n- Enter to open the selected result\n- role=\"option\" on items, role=\"listbox\" on container\n- First item gets tabIndex=0 for keyboard entry\n\nFixes WCAG 2.1 2.1.1 (Keyboard) for the search modal.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n* [Studio UI] Fix dual tabIndex and add aria-selected on search results\n\n- first prop only true when no item is selected (prevents two\n  tabIndex=0 items in the listbox)\n- Added aria-selected on each option for screen readers\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n* [Studio UI] Remove stale audit doc from PR scope\n\nThe keyboard-navigation-audit.md was accidentally included. It''s a\npre-remediation snapshot that becomes stale as fixes land.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvhLcCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAdWQQAB74EsJHWM2XCYXpFjg0+fqa\nH0vgJ70WLRPstK3+2UUun1i1QrBekV4Zap1ExJ/TzQpIPWo2QnxHplqRvuYhhCSZ\nyGYh+NIyjzi/16JLkpaznl+HGJn2x4VSMlDyU5qNuRc1QQ7ST2oQ9CGzoLn99