ndle/commits/e4c81a0d13d1840c98b852a032d964e83a818b96"}],"sha":"0672b2c2cbd7b3e0467f45b67ae104f42fa96cca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/studio-ui-bundle/commits/0672b2c2cbd7b3e0467f45b67ae104f42fa96cca"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138690998?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/idaiv/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/idaiv/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/idaiv/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/idaiv/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/idaiv","id":138690998,"login":"idaiv","node_id":"U_kgDOCERBtg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/idaiv/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/idaiv/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/idaiv/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/idaiv/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/idaiv/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/idaiv","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/studio-ui-bundle/commits/e4c81a0d13d1840c98b852a032d964e83a818b96/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T07:30:03Z","email":"138690998+idaiv@users.noreply.github.com","name":"idaiv"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T07:30:03Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[Studio UI] Fix sidebar tab selection firing on every keypress (#4046)\n\n* [Studio UI] Fix sidebar tab selection firing on every keypress\n\nThe onKeyDown handler triggered handleSidebarClick on any key,\nbreaking arrow key navigation within the sidebar. Restrict to\nEnter and Space only, matching the WAI-ARIA tab pattern.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n* [Studio UI] Add arrow key navigation between sidebar tabs\n\nAddress review: role=\"tab\" elements need arrow key focus movement.\nArrowDown/Right moves to next tab, ArrowUp/Left to previous (wraps).\nAlso apply roving tabindex: active tab gets tabIndex=0, others -1.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n* [Studio UI] Keep a sidebar tab reachable via Tab key while collapsed\n\nThe roving tabindex gave tabIndex=0 only to the active tab. With the\nsidebar collapsed (no active tab) every tab had tabIndex=-1, so keyboard\nusers could not reach the tablist at all. Fall back to the first tab\nwhen no entry is active.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f2ba8a170e2da9ce427e2e251d38e9e1514ee2e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/studio-ui-bundle/git/trees/f2ba8a170e2da9ce427e2e251d38e9e1514ee2e3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/studio-ui-bundle/git/commits/e4c81a0d13d1840c98b852a032d964e83a818b96","verification":{"payload":"tree f2ba8a170e2da9ce427e2e251d38e9e1514ee2e3\nparent be0decae946ff9ba19528278d72efb0ce82d0a7b\nauthor idaiv <138690998+idaiv@users.noreply.github.com> 1790839803 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790839803 +0200\n\n[Studio UI] Fix sidebar tab selection firing on every keypress (#4046)\n\n* [Studio UI] Fix sidebar tab selection firing on every keypress\n\nThe onKeyDown handler triggered handleSidebarClick on any key,\nbreaking arrow key navigation within the sidebar. Restrict to\nEnter and Space only, matching the WAI-ARIA tab pattern.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n* [Studio UI] Add arrow key navigation between sidebar tabs\n\nAddress review: role=\"tab\" elements need arrow key focus movement.\nArrowDown/Right moves to next tab, ArrowUp/Left to previous (wraps).\nAlso apply roving tabindex: active tab gets tabIndex=0, others -1.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n* [Studio UI] Keep a sidebar tab reachable via Tab key while collapsed\n\nThe roving tabindex gave tabIndex=0 only to the active tab. With the\nsidebar collapsed (no active tab) every tab had tabIndex=-1, so keyboard\nusers could not reach the tablist at all. Fall back to the first tab\nwhen no entry is active.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvgv7CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAApkMQADSOrY3+Lf5FRIT5fs9kjdDX\nOi3tloYSISukv+65Z6H2j1oHYGfl4DfLuZFHb8RWaZQlMDArHTD6tL7xxPU2tUeT\nrqLHLdbhkLS/Ez/dwi6yR7fwOs8ePNF3/xXwsYDuLHoC07OOwWdCZuvix+XrZ2DS\n1g+ei4+ySqu9+qtOWbMM8wUHdx5G5J+e3sw6Vj7wbXtIaIvbimI0P01dxAWK4CLq\nJxJ2pBrRHk/guVT1qMjDCDx1AllI91xBxY/KEczpzK2VhZHjTFWezLt1eJWwenkL\nprHb0WynsqENXLp1ghtX5AG0s1fRWrjcPrO6vdSUXIiPrwr/XCgrq63jIlA6FQxp\nEupztRWOYpeEMSLnUJ7Iqc0RWnBlE0Q0zIjFKEykESIDNcQGjlL8dAMUtvY6AqkD\nQATPWnMaiQc9Zg2cIhTsl+aTw+NNKzhy3yivo70VD/ts06oDpFO69vhAP6e73Iif\nEuy3c58KnPgkQTR5unNqm0lHhns03RpFcTe8C0nKXPxTDBTLaIajY71iKKhGqSpP\nIZmna7ow6VlbYTiVXjxUlE4vMoAylJZ6PzykyY8wZeGk/mWagTEB8aS5SvQym7TH\nT2iBuWTFtylzfCZNRas+MFIkiaF5hWOFhJulCpVWBfNpHq1brZ8rynR+FgVobN17\n7AR2tCnR5zwn+Knjk3os\n=Hd2W\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-01T07:30:03Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","n