received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melissakittl/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melissakittl/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melissakittl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melissakittl/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/melissakittl","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/studio-ui-bundle/commits/56f5e689f3946de97bcf59701428077bc446920a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T06:24:52Z","email":"melissa.kittl@valantic.at","name":"Melissa Kittl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T06:24:52Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[Document Editor] Hotspot/marker data: document field accepts documents instead of data objects (#4136)\n\nThe \"document\" case in field-operations.tsx carried the flags of the \"object\"\ncase (dataObjectsAllowed, documentsAllowed={ false }), so a document field only\noffered data objects in search and ignored documents dropped from the tree.","tree":{"sha":"6087b8d0959791849aba6621867ab799267e5b7f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/studio-ui-bundle/git/trees/6087b8d0959791849aba6621867ab799267e5b7f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/studio-ui-bundle/git/commits/56f5e689f3946de97bcf59701428077bc446920a","verification":{"payload":"tree 6087b8d0959791849aba6621867ab799267e5b7f\nparent 279575a3d3ed1616796592f9ed87ca797a48234b\nauthor Melissa Kittl <melissa.kittl@valantic.at> 1790835892 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790835892 +0200\n\n[Document Editor] Hotspot/marker data: document field accepts documents instead of data objects (#4136)\n\nThe \"document\" case in field-operations.tsx carried the flags of the \"object\"\ncase (dataObjectsAllowed, documentsAllowed={ false }), so a document field only\noffered data objects in search and ignored documents dropped from the tree.","