cdf42b3c5c225e3a8398fd7a06891f8d11d44d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T15:48:46Z","email":"valeriia.maltseva@pimcore.com","name":"Valeriia Maltseva"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T15:48:46Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[Docs] The Studio Example Bundle now ships its build as an archive (#4124)\n\n* [Docs] The Studio Example Bundle now ships its build as an archive\n\nThe Example Bundle moved from a committed public/build/ directory to a\ncommitted build-dist/build-<id>.zip (pimcore/studio-example-bundle#40),\nso it is no longer an example of the \"commit the expanded build\ndirectory\" option, and the provider linked from Registering the Frontend\nBuild is no longer a plain provider.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* [Docs] Point the rsbuild main.ts link at its new line\n\npimcore/studio-example-bundle#40 added the build-id logic above the entry\nconfig, moving `main: ''./js/src/main.ts''` from line 49 to line 59.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"014ec353f66ab8ed87b034aecba140a054983c03","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/studio-ui-bundle/git/trees/014ec353f66ab8ed87b034aecba140a054983c03"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/studio-ui-bundle/git/commits/85cdf42b3c5c225e3a8398fd7a06891f8d11d44d","verification":{"payload":"tree 014ec353f66ab8ed87b034aecba140a054983c03\nparent 51dfb8e87bad90c28e6886d7a02a81665e8254ad\nauthor Valeriia Maltseva <valeriia.maltseva@pimcore.com> 1790783326 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790783326 +0200\n\n[Docs] The Studio Example Bundle now ships its build as an archive (#4124)\n\n* [Docs] The Studio Example Bundle now ships its build as an archive\n\nThe Example Bundle moved from a committed public/build/ directory to a\ncommitted build-dist/build-<id>.zip (pimcore/studio-example-bundle#40),\nso it is no longer an example of the \"commit the expanded build\ndirectory\" option, and the provider linked from Registering the Frontend\nBuild is no longer a plain provider.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* [Docs] Point the rsbuild main.ts link at its new line\n\npimcore/studio-example-bundle#40 added the build-id logic above the entry\nconfig, moving `main: ''./js/src/main.ts''` from line 49 to line 59.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvS9eCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA6wgQAEylXIbIRhC7zUhUXf8LRhY0\ngTrKtcqJPUxLRkOWFiiYGLN5T8RoAMQN1Uzl6g6whspPloweSnYCqqAltwqi5kS9\nEJ81oWoacLbJ7SfrIT1PBtGzXsaa55u4XrjojctBLLM4+tC7Vy1E0/PkVZmtylcC\nXATBj7ETooSorl2JnqA0sbCPmzJ6+15j6PpGqLkR7RaQgiPzf495av7HxQSfVAjF\nBNVAgZ27s006zQsQJks4K5sm7rfzEJQyCOeosh4NFvu8dY1Un5TWBtRyDQ/sszjs\nPQVOyL8DyuCXnyscTFPxz8s1WuDVAuTrH8rGNsfmSLKDyN3DOWSSeK+3laOI/J2q\nxZSz/CNwd78CNB85XaEdz7u/x7ChBG8QewgAAg7kmPVdAuuaaEr0HUgEt4I2mxLz\nLrBZx/+Wm/gNS2MtkhPuSAzaXjZVzfTybTuhI5baykTr06m9ZkxPNK/vTAEbqpSL\nOROvofp51WZTnjRs9foNZHvr5qiVFdoQB50hY7vNJx2Slu9/EAz+R/ENlZnXjbCP\nLu9Muej8TXI3xRfC/acJGR1oOKE+wmn1UQo+RWO6+U063ycTkGRNNhMQcuZ+WmxS\nsdpTIH6nA3Bd7ZlBKhCg0B8nTS4+FM+fK2dUP1Rhh1PyvJI3TlI0pPdi2NadmXIW\nSLjPMh0vwCks5hqMZVqz\n=fsBx\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T15:48:47Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ