ttps://api.github.com/users/xIrusux","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/studio-ui-bundle/commits/167f63a5095431fccfd41ec160292205993acf23/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T11:47:01Z","email":"42359615+xIrusux@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Tine"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T11:47:01Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[Perspectives] Hide paste and reject drops for classes a tree widget does not allow (2025.4) (#4141)\n\n* [Perspectives] Hide paste and reject drops for classes a tree widget does not allow\n\nElement tree widgets restricted via `classes` showed paste entries for any\ncopied or cut data object, so a Category could be pasted into a Cars-only\nwidget and vanish from both trees. Gate the paste submenu, \"paste cut-out\nelement\" and drag-and-drop on the widget''s class allowlist, mirroring\nadmin-ui-classic-bundle#881.\n\nResolves #3414\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n(cherry picked from commit 6eeacfc29619badb4496121a5fb37b43eab5e1d6)\n\n* [Perspectives] Address Copilot review: isUndefined guards and unit tests for useTreeClassRestriction\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n(cherry picked from commit 18355a2fbdc59204bc9c21df3b477a6f364d9bef)\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"86086835f72130cbd6b23ca48f122aa232aed39b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/studio-ui-bundle/git/trees/86086835f72130cbd6b23ca48f122aa232aed39b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/studio-ui-bundle/git/commits/167f63a5095431fccfd41ec160292205993acf23","verification":{"payload":"tree 86086835f72130cbd6b23ca48f122aa232aed39b\nparent 4721ade53e93dd4cf327752f42abfa6c5f1331e6\nauthor Tine <42359615+xIrusux@users.noreply.github.com> 1790768821 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790768821 +0200\n\n[Perspectives] Hide paste and reject drops for classes a tree widget does not allow (2025.4) (#4141)\n\n* [Perspectives] Hide paste and reject drops for classes a tree widget does not allow\n\nElement tree widgets restricted via `classes` showed paste entries for any\ncopied or cut data object, so a Category could be pasted into a Cars-only\nwidget and vanish from both trees. Gate the paste submenu, \"paste cut-out\nelement\" and drag-and-drop on the widget''s class allowlist, mirroring\nadmin-ui-classic-bundle#881.\n\nResolves #3414\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n(cherry picked from commit 6eeacfc29619badb4496121a5fb37b43eab5e1d6)\n\n* [Perspectives] Address Copilot review: isUndefined guards and unit tests for useTreeClassRestriction\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n(cherry picked from commit 18355a2fbdc59204bc9c21df3b477a6f364d9bef)\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvPa1CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA1jkQAFBLkS59ZTo21P7XwshFR6TP\ny7GKjulCyC42XlunT5/Ltg5w2frGWIuHDnjF2tEqCv0gCR0JeTELvP+b4BuIO7/e\n9KvABxoLslcoWs4XrLaBH+uD7JR3ZBZNH6Q8x5pr2Ro40uw3pEdGyXtNbjvLBeWr\nJi96+kbf9nmgd2Uft+CBrlmwgbomt8LlTBxIV7J9uJZmasnIrCCX5Nw8g7Gm9HR/\nnIFMgTHQEU8vDlakAhMnBVWiZI5wx65ezlolAC0ku79xhzoACxzx8HKCCnyNi2Eu\nzl/Jwsa34AoKnBxMpohIaBd8MSys4MfVwBC9cD0cAwcNGny9UTiycaz1WLCarS5q\nXjSjIsEb40Zy9sgT2aYgAiTo/3l27/eHJo+0irAQHvN6nEywZahp2kcn1lkccpwd\nM1TSluuKNqB1yiM1i5GPLOUucxSfm+Q/q2ViXTzX9fRUJulum9TnX+LHhaWBswbd\nTYR9/R+y94HZqTtMl8D9rbWVJzEDscVOOunxasHD9ETztS7+gLLPfF9TtWjQxZ20\nW8QYaxR+lnoLYU3SS03CW77PSIk4gN2GOhxXhmgXwp+iQlfwDoS5HaK7dECZ8j2v\ntScOp1K/sRqHWchDORKUqbUWAoG4FuyOPIFK8KPDidqLQiU3hq3TAXaA3LE/KETL\nBaXpTdU98tlktwKFAF4V\n=Hsmz\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T11:47:01Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privac