Editor] Highlight empty required editables nested in blocks\n\nThe required-field highlight looked up the editable container by\n`pimcore_editable_<name>`, but core builds the DOM id with \":\" and \".\"\nreplaced by \"_\". Editables inside blocks/areablocks (e.g.\n`content:1.headline`) were therefore never marked on publish. Use the\neditable definition''s id instead.\n\nFixes pimcore/platform-version#338\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: ValeriaMaltseva <11871778+ValeriaMaltseva@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"8c6837cc1a5e231cae726202f3a04a87e9b982af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/studio-ui-bundle/git/trees/8c6837cc1a5e231cae726202f3a04a87e9b982af"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/studio-ui-bundle/git/commits/3a70ad06964e666ff514f1ce8f3c5574a648af36","verification":{"payload":"tree 8c6837cc1a5e231cae726202f3a04a87e9b982af\nparent 382e9bcce8b8be364a45ea5a25c528675678c4e8\nauthor Valeriia Maltseva <valeriia.maltseva@pimcore.com> 1790759752 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790759752 +0200\n\n[Document Editor] Highlight empty required editables nested in blocks (#4140)\n\n* [Document Editor] Highlight empty required editables nested in blocks\n\nThe required-field highlight looked up the editable container by\n`pimcore_editable_<name>`, but core builds the DOM id with \":\" and \".\"\nreplaced by \"_\". Editables inside blocks/areablocks (e.g.\n`content:1.headline`) were therefore never marked on publish. Use the\neditable definition''s id instead.\n\nFixes pimcore/platform-version#338\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: ValeriaMaltseva <11871778+ValeriaMaltseva@users.noreply.github.com>"