M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: ValeriaMaltseva <11871778+ValeriaMaltseva@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"c8a4ef7d6876751d603ea7bdb6a604f0bc358f0b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/studio-ui-bundle/git/trees/c8a4ef7d6876751d603ea7bdb6a604f0bc358f0b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/studio-ui-bundle/git/commits/21b63d7c97ebe2a96bffc1845f71c7a4383449cc","verification":{"payload":"tree c8a4ef7d6876751d603ea7bdb6a604f0bc358f0b\nparent e757409f9bd6628b2fc15e457e393080a6d70432\nauthor Valeriia Maltseva <valeriia.maltseva@pimcore.com> 1790759041 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790759041 +0200\n\n[Properties] Translate predefined property names in the select (#4142)\n\n* [Properties] Translate predefined property names in the select\n\nThe predefined properties select rendered the raw `name`, so names stored\nas translation keys (e.g. `predefined.property.nofollow`) were shown\nuntranslated. Translate the name before using it as the option label and\nsort by the translated label, so ordering and search match what is shown.\n\nFixes pimcore/platform-version#358\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: ValeriaMaltseva <11871778+ValeriaMaltseva@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvNCBCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAArXwQAFwLhrEFJF8VgkGfPNZP1+ut\nqMjcuKTX7NrAN3yrvx4kAhBes0tTVKNOdqIj7YPUlSqks05MV/Eui0nTBcw+7H/v\nI3rfzbLmQRNSHtbOMCsVxBXHVetw423Lfr4i6sUHiEghtUQRQlKRglh6eNMyL8AG\nAuwJLJmzHpc6hFvBLOshuru2B9wKoMaYUNm82FlGiQPh23isgZlcd/zGWVWTIcQK\nhDb/2C+7wenulINcna9ei8T7y68mXwmLeUdD7GioQSLwiFAG3Jx+rh4PUKttDKUB\nO7pAyqxUf7i30ZZmNcnvFKqysRZBXmNRwAJA5IbE5D2GCCOm4Yp5XPUIA4UX6Bbi\nlhOKI7kYcsyBeO16h