s://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.frigate/commits/f05931381ab02701753568351e48919e986e3fdf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T13:51:11Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T13:51:11Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"message":"The Frigate directory can no longer be left empty by accident: the validator complained but did not stop the dialog from being saved. With an empty directory the plugin mounts named volumes instead of the chosen directory, while the adapter writes `config.yml` into the ioBroker data directory - Frigate then starts without its configuration","tree":{"sha":"545e7a0043ce20463c7a74b4b25c13aa3bf58206","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.frigate/git/trees/545e7a0043ce20463c7a74b4b25c13aa3bf58206"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.frigate/git/commits/f05931381ab02701753568351e48919e986e3fdf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.