manBluefox) Added two widgets for ioBroker.devices: a snapshot tile that works everywhere, and a live MJPEG tile\n- (@GermanBluefox) Added the `snapshot` message, which returns the current picture of a camera as base64\n- (Eistee82) Fixed zone object counters (e.g. `<zone>.person`) staying at their last value after the object left the zone. Per-zone object counts are now sourced solely from the Frigate MQTT occupancy topics, and the zone aggregator resets its active/stationary states to 0 and uses `current_zones` instead of the cumulative `entered_zones`.","tree":{"sha":"66d7caf3c369ee8373782b66503c999cc8d4667d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.frigate/git/trees/66d7caf3c369ee8373782b66503c999cc8d4667d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.frigate/git/commits/3c375033790ad2d0a197951ebcea17543e132260","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"