ull,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.frigate/commit/3b684c80f6adaf38bdd761c41b5d08d663b01c48","node_id":"C_kwDOLHy_BNoAKDNiNjg0YzgwZjZhZGFmMzhiZGQ3NjFjNDFiNWQwOGQ2NjNiMDFjNDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.frigate/commit/36cd0b760a96345aeae6a003a197927730e99276","sha":"36cd0b760a96345aeae6a003a197927730e99276","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.frigate/commits/36cd0b760a96345aeae6a003a197927730e99276"}],"sha":"3b684c80f6adaf38bdd761c41b5d08d663b01c48","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.frigate/commits/3b684c80f6adaf38bdd761c41b5d08d663b01c48"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.frigate/commits/36cd0b760a96345aeae6a003a197927730e99276/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T15:04:01Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T15:04:01Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"message":"Serve the cameras through the web adapter and add device widgets\n\nFrigate serves snapshots and MJPEG itself, but its URLs are of little use in a\nvisualization: the API is usually bound to 127.0.0.1, port 8971 wants a JWT the\nbrowser does not have, an http Frigate inside an https ioBroker.web is blocked\nas mixed content, and none of it is behind the ioBroker authentication.\n\nWeb extension (src/lib/web.ts, registered as common.webExtension)\n  GET /frigate.0/<camera>/snapshot.jpg   ->  /api/<camera>/latest.jpg\n  GET /frigate.0/<camera>/stream.mjpeg   ->  /api/<camera>\n\n  Query parameters are passed through by whitelist, the camera name is checked\n  against /^[A-Za-z0-9_-]+$/ so a crafted name cannot leave /api/<camera>/, and\n  the MJPEG response is piped and torn down when the browser leaves - Frigate\n  encodes it per viewer. The extension does its own /api/login because it lives\n  in the ioBroker.web process and cannot use the axios instance of the adapter;\n  concurrent 401s share a single login.\n\nDevice manager widgets (src-devices/, common.deviceWidgets)\n  A module federation bundle, built with \"npm run devices-build\" into\n  admin/dm-widgets/.\n\n  - Frigate Snapshot asks the adapter over the socket and therefore works\n    wherever the Devices UI runs, including inside admin.\n  - Frigate Live shows the MJPEG stream. That route belongs to the web adapter,\n    which the Devices UI can only reach from a web instance, so the web instance\n    can be named in the widget settings.\n\n  New \"snapshot\" message for the first one, plus \"frigate:getCameras\" to fill\n  the camera drop-down of both.\n\nThis commit also carries a dependency update and the added i18n and jsonConfig\nentries that were pending in the working tree.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9bd2b50cd46c29d755594bde22458f3644aac442","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.frigate/git/trees/9bd2b50cd46c29d755594bde22458f3644aac442"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.frigate/git/commits/36cd0b760a96345aeae6a003a197927730e99276","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.c